### =====================================================
### RETAIL - OMNI-CHANNEL CUSTOMER LOYALTY & REWARDS
### CAPSTONE TEST CASES
### =====================================================


### =====================================================
### 1. SERVICE & METADATA
### =====================================================

### Get Service Metadata
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/$metadata


### =====================================================
### 2. READ - CUSTOMERS
### =====================================================

### Get All Customers
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Customers


### Get Specific Customer - Ananya
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Customers(11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111)


### =====================================================
### 3. READ - TRANSACTIONS
### =====================================================

### Get All Transactions
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Transactions


### Get Specific Transaction
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Transactions(aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaa1)


### =====================================================
### 4. READ - REDEMPTIONS
### =====================================================

### Get All Redemptions
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Redemptions


### Get Specific Redemption
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Redemptions(bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbb1)


### =====================================================
### 5. READ - REWARD POLICIES
### =====================================================

### Get All Reward Policies
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/RewardPolicies


### Get Active Reward Policy
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/RewardPolicies?$filter=isActive eq true


### Get Specific Reward Policy
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/RewardPolicies(99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999991)


### =====================================================
### 6. CUSTOMER CRUD - CREATE
### =====================================================

### Create New Customer
POST http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerID": "66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666",
    "name": "Sneha Patil",
    "email": "sneha.patil@gmail.com",
    "totalPoints": 0,
    "tier": "BRONZE"
}


### =====================================================
### 7. CUSTOMER CRUD - READ CREATED CUSTOMER
### =====================================================

### Read Created Customer
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Customers(66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666)


### =====================================================
### 8. CUSTOMER CRUD - UPDATE
### =====================================================

### Update Customer Email
PATCH http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Customers(66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "sneha.patil.updated@gmail.com"
}


### =====================================================
### 9. CUSTOMER CRUD - DELETE
### =====================================================

### Delete Created Customer
DELETE http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Customers(66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666)


### =====================================================
### 10. RECORD PURCHASE - STORE
### =====================================================

### Store Purchase
### Customer: Ananya Deshmukh
### Amount: ₹1000
### Expected points: 1000 × 0.05 = 50
POST http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/recordPurchase
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerID": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
    "channel": "Store",
    "amount": 1000
}


### =====================================================
### 11. RECORD PURCHASE - ONLINE
### =====================================================

### Online Purchase
### Customer: Rohan Kulkarni
### Amount: ₹2000
### Base points: 2000 × 0.05 = 100
### onlineMultiplier = 1.00
### Expected points: 100
POST http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/recordPurchase
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerID": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
    "channel": "Online",
    "amount": 2000
}


### =====================================================
### 12. VERIFY PURCHASE
### =====================================================

### Check Tanya after Store Purchase
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Customers(11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111)


### Check Rohan after Online Purchase
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Customers(22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222)


### Check Transactions
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Transactions


