### =====================================================
### 16. SUCCESSFUL REDEMPTION
### =====================================================

### Customer: Ananya
### After purchase: 120 + 50 = 170
### Redeem: 50
### Expected remaining points: 120
POST http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/redeemPoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerID": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
    "pointsUsed": 50,
    "remarks": "Discount voucher"
}


### =====================================================
### 17. VERIFY REDEMPTION
### =====================================================

### Check Ananya after redemption
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Customers(11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111)


### Check Redemption Records
GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/Redemptions


### =====================================================
### 18. INSUFFICIENT POINTS
### =====================================================

### Ananya currently has 120 points
### Attempt to redeem 500 points
### Expected: HTTP 400
### Expected message:

### Insufficient loyalty points. Available points: 120

POST http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/redeemPoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerID": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
    "pointsUsed": 500,
    "remarks": "Insufficient points test"
}


### =====================================================
### 19. INVALID REDEMPTION AMOUNT
### =====================================================

### Zero Points
POST http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/redeemPoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerID": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
    "pointsUsed": 0,
    "remarks": "Invalid redemption"
}


### Negative Points
POST http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/redeemPoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerID": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
    "pointsUsed": -10,
