### =====================================================
### 21. REWARD POLICY - UPDATE
### =====================================================

### Modify Existing Reward Policy
### Change base rate from 0.05 to 0.10
PATCH http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/RewardPolicies(99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999991)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "baseRate": 0.10
}


### =====================================================
### 22. VERIFY REWARD POLICY UPDATE
### =====================================================

GET http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/RewardPolicies(99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999991)


### =====================================================
### 23. RESTORE ORIGINAL POLICY
### =====================================================

### Restore required capstone rule:
### ₹1 = 0.05 points

PATCH http://localhost:4004/loyaltyrewards/RewardPolicies(99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999991)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "baseRate": 0.05
}


